  "title": "Procurement Policy Note 06/20 – taking account of social value in the award of central government contracts",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/procurement-policy-note-0620-taking-account-of-social-value-in-the-award-of-central-government-contracts",
  "description": "This note sets out how to take account of social value in the award of central government contracts by using the Social Value Model.",
